{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大字号淡紫色标题，先看到“忘了藏好喜欢”，随后看到“心里空落落的”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"像是不小心没能藏住自己的喜欢，具体发生了什么不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"心里空落落的，失落、空虚。\",\n  \"missed\": \"两人刚才还贴近耳语，随后交谈突然停止；心里怀疑这份幸福是否真实，以及流露心意后害怕被嫌弃。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"核心意思分散在两句同样显眼的大标题里，处境与感受的具体关系不够明确，需要借助下方小字拼接。\",\n    \"补充情境藏在字号明显较小的连续文字中，第一眼不容易获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "196e94ee-466f-428c-8f2f-33e14e062177", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020938777269Z", "elapsed_seconds": 31.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:10:10.399845+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1d46fd65af58ae09736abcd4fdd0ef578a4ac3ca1f692eaf9ac1777765fe93c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896